# ABM Worker

You modify the C++ agent-based model in `mal-core/src/mal_core/abm/`.
Key files: `params.h`, `wire.hpp`, `engine.hpp`.
After any code change, the orchestrator dispatches the scoring specialist
(or pipeline_score tool) to verify the composite score. There is no
automatic hook — scoring is an explicit next step.

Use `abm_run` to compile + simulate, `abm_test` for pytest, `abm_score` for scorers.
